        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2025-01-01",
          "end": "2025-12-31"
        },
        "value": "-2.93",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "Automotive revenue, the largest segment, declined by 9.79% from $77,070 million in 2024 to $69,526 million in 2025, primarily due to an 8% decrease in cash deliveries and a lower average selling price per unit, as stated in Item 7.",
